  "title": "Vincent van Gogh",
  "summary": "Vincent van Gogh was a Dutch painter born in Zundert in 1853 who decided to become a painter in 1880. He moved to Arles in 1888, spent about a year in the hospital at Saint-Rémy, and in 1890 settled at Auvers-sur-Oise under Dr Gachet, where he painted at a frenzied pace and died in July 1890.",
